# GreenDrop 🌱

GreenDrop is a platform designed to connect donors with NGOs and
make the donation process easier and more efficient.

## Features

- Donor registration and login
- NGO registration and login
- Donation listings
- Donation acceptance
- Image uploads
- Donation status tracking
- Firebase integration

## Tech Stack

- Flutter
- Dart
- Firebase Authentication
- Firebase Firestore
- Firebase Storage

## My Contribution

